      "side": 1,
      "message": "vm_payload.h should be the source of truth for this, since it\u0027s all clients get.\n\nHence the suggestion to use bindgen to make it available to Rust, rather than vice versa.",
      "parentUuid": "5d3c1182_13a1edb1",
